            "review_title": "Review at Vu Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Marie C\nNormandy, France9 contributions\n0\nVù Cuisine to delight you!\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nLong stay in Hue, we went four times in January and most recently on February 28, 2024. We tasted the famous pizzas and the crab pasta are excellent, we will come back with pleasure, the staff is professional, attentive (a little word in French) and kind. The relaxing musical atmosphere and best of all the boss is very nice, he even turned the oven back on to make us two pizzas, even though it was closing time. Above all, don't hesitate between one or the other. Choose Vù Cuisine to enjoy yourself, it's not the factory, it's a restaurant, a real Italian.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten February 28, 2024",
