            "review_title": "Review at Vu Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Moesis\nMilan, Italy3 contributions\n0\nPassed with flying colours, excellent service\nJan 2024 • Couples\nDelicious dishes, excellent pizza, much better than many Italian pizzerias, the pizza was rightly juicy and not dry, not contaminated by local flavours, the gnocchi with delicious fish bisque, the fillet a little small but so soft that it could be \"cut with a breadstick\" the accompanying vegetables are crunchy but not tough and the puree is excellent. 4 beers. Vanilla ice cream made with whipped cream and vanilla all for $35. What can I say passed with flying colors\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 7, 2024",
